        "Known toolchain defect: vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js 3.5.2 in package-lock.json, where the CSS is injected by JavaScript, puts the code that injects the CSS in front of the chunk without shifting its source map, so the map the bundler combines from it loses sources. Here the map of AccountHeader-W6uwaS_Y.chunk.mjs names 0 of the 1 package its .license file names, and 5 further chunks show the same.",
